{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"code":["import EventMacros","import TrackingPlans","","@Event(name: \"checkout_started\", version: 2)","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var cartSize: Int","    var coupon: String?","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan(schemas: [CheckoutStarted.schema])","plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", \"checkout_started.v2.schema.json\", \"checkout_started.v2.example.json\"]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan’s files are values, so the same schemas give the same bytes on every run and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform: keys sorted by their UTF-8 bytes, two-space indentation, a trailing newline and no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timestamps."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each event’s document is named ","type":"text"},{"code":"<name>.v<version>.schema.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", its name with every byte but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ASCII letters, digits, ","type":"text"},{"code":"_","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"-","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" percent-encoded (","type":"text"},{"code":"Box<String>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Box%3CString%3E","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document describes the event’s properties as a JSON object:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"c